@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2015-2026 Contributors as noted in the AUTHORS file
+ *
+ * This file is part of Solo5, a sandboxed execution environment.
+ *
+ * Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software
